# Pairs with OnlySupersededRefused. An activation stops at its claim although its
# epoch row is as it read it: the conflict check is dropped, so a claimant
# nothing superseded deactivates.
MODULE: OnlySupersededRefusedConflictWithoutMove
TARGET: OnlySupersededRefused
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: ClaimConflict stops an activation whose epoch row has not moved
PERTURBS: ClaimConflict

--- FIND
    /\ ~RowUnmoved(a)
    /\ up' = up \ {a}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no conflict needed.
    /\ up' = up \ {a}
--- END
